  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math><br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"double-struck\">*</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là dãy số tăng.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℕ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"double-struck\">*</mo></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math> Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là dãy số bị chặn.",
